<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment. Actual producer: Codex (gpt-6-astra), reconciliation. GMR's source wording, including the explanatory bracket, is preserved verbatim; no hgm_gloss change. The hypothetical negation ma owns not at English [797,800], after Suppose the blue were, never the bracket's not yet perceived emptiness at [526,529]. That bracket explains tshur mthong, whose established quoted designation only sees this side is retained. Positive full glossary readings for tshur mthong and dbang po'i mngon sum were checked; they do not license supplied framing or the neighboring appearance verb as dictionary words. dbang po owns sense, mngon sum owns directly, and snang ba owns appeared; the additional perception component is distributed and left unwrapped. Three sngon 'dzin occurrences own grasping blue and the two later perception of blue occurrences. Two separate seed chains own mental seed/plants/ripens and mental seed/planted/ripened; bzhag pa is planting here, not the unrelated provisional nothing but gloss. The first positive dependence transition la brten nas is distributed across the seed-growth explanation and omitted. Final la ma bltos par owns independent of, preserving the hypothetical independence from karmic planting and ripening. The final dngos po/gsum po/snang dgos own objects/three/would be appearing in the resulting three-object claim. The earlier temporal dngos po gsum snang ba is condensed in the setup and omitted; each of the objects is an English reprise. Both likeness of itself expressions remain complete d3 phrases rang 'dra'i rnam pa; their transmitting verbs and means relations retain their own occurrences. Other condensed, deictic, conditional and copular material is omitted rather than assigned a null; only active-subject gyis and kyis lack separate word exponents.</div>
